                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Bon Secours Wellness Arena has graciously opened their doors for SC Department of Public Health to operate a 24-hour Emergency Medical Needs Shelter. \n\nTeam South Carolina is out in full force. Governor @henrymcmaster is using every resource at his disposal, we are working to get more counties included in the disaster declaration (Greenville and Spartanburg are already approved), and at my urging, the White House and Treasury announced updated IRS tax relief guidance. \n\nWe have gotten through the hardest part. Now we have to have patience to get through the rest.",
