                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Allowing individuals to sleep in tents on the streets is not compassion \u2014 it is neglect.\n\nThat is why I introduced the CAMPS Act (H.R. 5163) to restore safety and order in Washington, D.C. This bill will ban camping on public property \u2014 no tents, tarps, or makeshift shelters. \n\nPassing this bill sends a clear message: America\u2019s capital will be clean, managed, and worthy of the nation it represents! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
